  "answer": "The archive has this request already. terminal#8914 (\"Profile reordering for Settings UI\") is the main tracking issue, and terminal#19168 was closed as a duplicate of it. It asks for a way to reorder profiles in the Settings UI, and it is still open as a feature request. Your extra ask, showing extension entries in the new-tab view, is not covered by either ticket, so I treated it as part of the same request. You can add your use case to #8914 and follow it there. Until it ships, reorder the entries in the `profiles.list` array in settings.json. The new-tab dropdown follows that order. If you only want certain profiles to open quickly, you can also bind `newTab` actions to specific profile indexes."
